  "transcription_policy": "Modern punctuation supplied. Existing recorded Unicode forms, including mixed 无/無, are retained without claiming uniform normalization; new Qian15 headers retain printed 无. Historical font forms are mapped to Unicode; lexical variants are not silently replaced by another edition. Not a diplomatic glyph transcription. Yu16 retains printed 于/恒/无 and records per-header reading status; an uncertain header is not silently certified through the corpus-wide review label. Sui17retains printed于and亨; punctuation editorial, independent second review pending. NewGu18retains printed无in two headers rather than retroactively applying another entry normalization; punctuation editorial. NewLin19preserves printed无forms; sixheaders on163/164/165, punctuation editorial. NewGuan20 retains printed闚/无/于, six completeheaders on166/167; punctuation editorial, independent review pending. Shike21 preserves selected履/腊/胏/何/无; editorialpunctuation disclosed. Independent review pending. Ben22 preserves selected于/无; headers170/171/172, editorial punctuation and independent review pending. Bo23 headers173/174/175 retain selected床/无/宮人; Bo2辨 is qualified in its entry. Editorial punctuation and Unicode forms do not establish independent certification. Patch14.0.1 withdraws own introduced Bo5无 for visibly printed無; Bo3无 remains. Firstdraft and firstcandidate preserved, no inherited-error credit. Fu24 and Wuwang25 retain selected printed无/穫/菑/畬 and 用行師 ordering. Fu1祗/祇 remains tentative in its header entry. Editorial punctuation and Unicode selection are not independent glyph certification. Daxu26 retains selected printed說/日/衞 and a qualified己/已 choice. Editorial Unicode mapping and punctuation are not independent glyph certification.",
  "total_line_headers": 384,
  "entries": [
    {
      "hexagram": "乾為天",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 119,
      "yaoci": "潛龍勿用。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "乾為天",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 120,
      "yaoci": "見龍在田，利見大人。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "乾為天",
      "line": 3,
      "pdf_page": 120,
      "yaoci": "君子終日乾乾，夕惕若厲，無咎。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "乾為天",
      "line": 4,
      "pdf_page": 120,
      "yaoci": "或躍在淵，無咎。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "乾為天",
      "line": 5,
      "pdf_page": 121,
      "yaoci": "飛龍在天，利見大人。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "乾為天",
      "line": 6,
      "pdf_page": 121,
      "yaoci": "亢龍有悔。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "坤為地",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 122,
      "yaoci": "履霜，堅冰至。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "坤為地",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 122,
      "yaoci": "直方大，不習無不利。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "坤為地",
      "line": 3,
      "pdf_page": 122,
      "yaoci": "含章可貞，或從王事，無成有終。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "坤為地",
      "line": 4,
      "pdf_page": 123,
      "yaoci": "括囊，無咎，無譽。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "坤為地",
      "line": 5,
      "pdf_page": 123,
      "yaoci": "黃裳，元吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "坤為地",
      "line": 6,
      "pdf_page": 123,
      "yaoci": "龍戰于野，其血玄黃。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水雷屯",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 124,
      "yaoci": "盤桓，利居貞，利建侯。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水雷屯",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 125,
      "yaoci": "屯如邅如，乘馬班如，匪寇婚媾，女子貞不字，十年乃字。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水雷屯",
      "line": 3,
      "pdf_page": 125,
      "yaoci": "即鹿無虞，惟入于林中，君子幾不如舍，往吝。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水雷屯",
      "line": 4,
      "pdf_page": 125,
      "yaoci": "乘馬班如，求婚媾，往吉，無不利。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水雷屯",
      "line": 5,
      "pdf_page": 126,
      "yaoci": "屯其膏，小貞吉，大貞凶。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水雷屯",
      "line": 6,
      "pdf_page": 126,
      "yaoci": "乘馬班如，泣血漣如。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "山水蒙",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 126,
      "yaoci": "發蒙，利用刑人，用脫桎梏，以往吝。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "山水蒙",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 127,
      "yaoci": "包蒙吉，納婦吉，子克家。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "山水蒙",
      "line": 3,
      "pdf_page": 127,
      "yaoci": "勿用取女，見金夫，不有躬，無攸利。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "山水蒙",
      "line": 4,
      "pdf_page": 128,
      "yaoci": "困蒙，吝。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "山水蒙",
      "line": 5,
      "pdf_page": 128,
      "yaoci": "童蒙，吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "山水蒙",
      "line": 6,
      "pdf_page": 128,
      "yaoci": "擊蒙，不利為寇，利禦寇。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水天需",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 129,
      "yaoci": "需于郊，利用恆，無咎。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水天需",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 129,
      "yaoci": "需于沙，小有言，終吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水天需",
      "line": 3,
      "pdf_page": 130,
      "yaoci": "需于泥，致寇至。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水天需",
      "line": 4,
      "pdf_page": 130,
      "yaoci": "需于血，出自穴。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水天需",
      "line": 5,
      "pdf_page": 130,
      "yaoci": "需于酒食，貞吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水天需",
      "line": 6,
      "pdf_page": 131,
      "yaoci": "入于穴，有不速之客三人來，敬之終吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天水訟",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 131,
      "yaoci": "不永所事，小有言，終吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天水訟",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 132,
      "yaoci": "不克訟，歸而逋，其邑人三百戶，無眚。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天水訟",
      "line": 3,
      "pdf_page": 132,
      "yaoci": "食舊德，貞厲，終吉，或從王事，無成。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天水訟",
      "line": 4,
      "pdf_page": 132,
      "yaoci": "不克訟，復即命渝，安貞吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天水訟",
      "line": 5,
      "pdf_page": 133,
      "yaoci": "訟，元吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天水訟",
      "line": 6,
      "pdf_page": 133,
      "yaoci": "或錫之鞶帶，終朝三褫之。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地水師",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 134,
      "yaoci": "師出以律，否臧凶。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地水師",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 134,
      "yaoci": "在師中吉，無咎，王三錫命。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地水師",
      "line": 3,
      "pdf_page": 135,
      "yaoci": "師或輿尸，凶。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地水師",
      "line": 4,
      "pdf_page": 135,
      "yaoci": "師左次，無咎。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地水師",
      "line": 5,
      "pdf_page": 135,
      "yaoci": "田有禽，利執言，無咎，長子帥師，弟子輿尸，貞凶。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地水師",
      "line": 6,
      "pdf_page": 136,
      "yaoci": "大君有命，開國承家，小人勿用。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水地比",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 136,
      "yaoci": "有孚比之，無咎，有孚盈缶，終來有他吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水地比",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 137,
      "yaoci": "比之自內，貞吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水地比",
      "line": 3,
      "pdf_page": 137,
      "yaoci": "比之匪人。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水地比",
      "line": 4,
      "pdf_page": 137,
      "yaoci": "外比之，貞吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水地比",
      "line": 5,
      "pdf_page": 138,
      "yaoci": "顯比，王用三驅，失前禽，邑人不誡吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "水地比",
      "line": 6,
      "pdf_page": 138,
      "yaoci": "比之無首，凶。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "風天小畜",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 139,
      "yaoci": "復自道，何其咎，吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "風天小畜",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 139,
      "yaoci": "牽復，吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "風天小畜",
      "line": 3,
      "pdf_page": 140,
      "yaoci": "輿脫輻，夫妻反目。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "風天小畜",
      "line": 4,
      "pdf_page": 140,
      "yaoci": "有孚，血去惕出，無咎。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "風天小畜",
      "line": 5,
      "pdf_page": 140,
      "yaoci": "有孚攣如，富以其鄰。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "風天小畜",
      "line": 6,
      "pdf_page": 141,
      "yaoci": "既雨既處，尚德載，婦貞厲，月幾望，君子征凶。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天澤履",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 141,
      "yaoci": "素履，往無咎。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天澤履",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 142,
      "yaoci": "履道坦坦，幽人貞吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天澤履",
      "line": 3,
      "pdf_page": 142,
      "yaoci": "眇能視，跛能履，履虎尾，咥人凶。武人為於大君。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天澤履",
      "line": 4,
      "pdf_page": 142,
      "yaoci": "履虎尾，愬愬終吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天澤履",
      "line": 5,
      "pdf_page": 143,
      "yaoci": "夬履，貞厲。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天澤履",
      "line": 6,
      "pdf_page": 143,
      "yaoci": "視履考祥，其旋元吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地天泰",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 144,
      "yaoci": "拔茅茹，以其彙，征吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地天泰",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 144,
      "yaoci": "包荒，用馮河，不遐遺，朋亡，得尚於中行。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地天泰",
      "line": 3,
      "pdf_page": 145,
      "yaoci": "無平不陂，無往不復，艱貞無咎，勿恤其孚，于食有福。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地天泰",
      "line": 4,
      "pdf_page": 145,
      "yaoci": "翩翩，不富以其鄰，不戒以孚。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地天泰",
      "line": 5,
      "pdf_page": 145,
      "yaoci": "帝乙歸妹，以祉元吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地天泰",
      "line": 6,
      "pdf_page": 146,
      "yaoci": "城復於隍，勿用師，自邑告命，貞吝。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天地否",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 146,
      "yaoci": "拔茅茹，以其彙，貞吉亨。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天地否",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 147,
      "yaoci": "包承，小人吉，大人否亨。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天地否",
      "line": 3,
      "pdf_page": 147,
      "yaoci": "包羞。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天地否",
      "line": 4,
      "pdf_page": 147,
      "yaoci": "有命無咎，疇離祉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天地否",
      "line": 5,
      "pdf_page": 148,
      "yaoci": "休否，大人吉，其亡其亡，繫于苞桑。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天地否",
      "line": 6,
      "pdf_page": 148,
      "yaoci": "傾否，先否後喜。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天火同人",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 149,
      "yaoci": "同人于門，無咎。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天火同人",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 149,
      "yaoci": "同人于宗，吝。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天火同人",
      "line": 3,
      "pdf_page": 150,
      "yaoci": "伏戎于莽，升其高陵，三歲不興。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天火同人",
      "line": 4,
      "pdf_page": 150,
      "yaoci": "乘其墉，弗克攻，吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天火同人",
      "line": 5,
      "pdf_page": 150,
      "yaoci": "同人先號咷而後笑，大師克相遇。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "天火同人",
      "line": 6,
      "pdf_page": 151,
      "yaoci": "同人于郊，無悔。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "火天大有",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 151,
      "yaoci": "无交害，匪咎，艱則无咎。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "火天大有",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 152,
      "yaoci": "大車以載，有攸往，无咎。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "火天大有",
      "line": 3,
      "pdf_page": 152,
      "yaoci": "公用亨于天子，小人弗克。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "火天大有",
      "line": 4,
      "pdf_page": 152,
      "yaoci": "匪其彭，无咎。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "火天大有",
      "line": 5,
      "pdf_page": 153,
      "yaoci": "厥孚交如，威如，吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "火天大有",
      "line": 6,
      "pdf_page": 153,
      "yaoci": "自天祐之，吉无不利。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地山謙",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 154,
      "yaoci": "謙謙君子，用涉大川，吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地山謙",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 154,
      "yaoci": "鳴謙，貞吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地山謙",
      "line": 3,
      "pdf_page": 154,
      "yaoci": "勞謙君子，有終吉。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地山謙",
      "line": 4,
      "pdf_page": 155,
      "yaoci": "无不利，撝謙。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地山謙",
      "line": 5,
      "pdf_page": 155,
      "yaoci": "不富以其鄰，利用侵伐，无不利。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "地山謙",
      "line": 6,
      "pdf_page": 155,
      "yaoci": "鳴謙，利用行師，征邑國。"
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "雷地豫",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 156,
      "yaoci": "鳴豫，凶。",
      "review_status": "single_reader_native_pixel_header_collation; independent_second_review_pending",
      "reading_notes": [
        "該版爻辭標點為編輯句讀，保留原有于、无等字形映射。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "雷地豫",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 156,
      "yaoci": "介于石，不終日，貞吉。",
      "review_status": "single_reader_native_pixel_header_collation; independent_second_review_pending",
      "reading_notes": [
        "該版爻辭標點為編輯句讀，保留原有于、无等字形映射。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "雷地豫",
      "line": 3,
      "pdf_page": 157,
      "yaoci": "盱豫，悔，遲有悔。",
      "review_status": "single_reader_native_pixel_header_collation; independent_second_review_pending",
      "reading_notes": [
        "該版爻辭標點為編輯句讀，保留原有于、无等字形映射。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "雷地豫",
      "line": 4,
      "pdf_page": 157,
      "yaoci": "由豫，大有得，勿疑，朋盍簪。",
      "review_status": "single_reader_native_pixel_header_collation; independent_second_review_pending; glyph_choice_unresolved",
      "reading_notes": [
        "該版爻辭標點為編輯句讀，保留原有于、无等字形映射。",
        "朋盍簪末字簪受印墨覆疊，暫錄；不以通行周易經文當作本版原字已核定。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "雷地豫",
      "line": 5,
      "pdf_page": 157,
      "yaoci": "貞疾，恒不死。",
      "review_status": "single_reader_native_pixel_header_collation; independent_second_review_pending",
      "reading_notes": [
        "該版爻辭標點為編輯句讀，保留原有于、无等字形映射。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "雷地豫",
      "line": 6,
      "pdf_page": 158,
      "yaoci": "冥豫，成有渝，无咎。",
      "review_status": "single_reader_native_pixel_header_collation; independent_second_review_pending",
      "reading_notes": [
        "該版爻辭標點為編輯句讀，保留原有于、无等字形映射。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "澤雷隨",
      "line": 1,
      "pdf_page": 158,
      "yaoci": "官有渝，貞吉。出門交有功。",
      "review_status": "single_reader_native_pixel_collation; independent_second_review_pending",
      "reading_notes": [
        "按所選文明書局本原圖逐爻目讀；標點為編輯句讀，保留原印于、亨，不用另一部周易文字代替。",
        "先封存源圖首稿與同讀者復讀，再比對繼承稿；沒有新增獨立讀稿或專家審校。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "澤雷隨",
      "line": 2,
      "pdf_page": 159,
      "yaoci": "係小子，失丈夫。",
      "review_status": "single_reader_native_pixel_collation; independent_second_review_pending",
      "reading_notes": [
        "按所選文明書局本原圖逐爻目讀；標點為編輯句讀，保留原印于、亨，不用另一部周易文字代替。",
        "先封存源圖首稿與同讀者復讀，再比對繼承稿；沒有新增獨立讀稿或專家審校。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "hexagram": "澤雷隨",
      "line": 3,
